<title>USA: Princeton Seminary, N.J., $21.6 mln deal postponed.</title>
<headline>Princeton Seminary, N.J., $21.6 mln deal postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Jersey Educational Facilities Authority has postponed a $21.6 million bond deal for Princeton Theological Seminary, market sources said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal was expected to price at 1100 EDT Wednesday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
